# Recordings and capture output land in the working directory.
*.mkv
*.mp4
*.png
# sound.rs renders cues to WAV when auditioning them, and those land wherever
# the tool that asked for them was pointed. Three of them reached the repo root.
*.wav

# Source assets are checked in explicitly: the logo is compiled into the client
# binary with include_bytes!, so a clone without it does not build.
!crates/orange-client/logo.png
